   "evidence": "`grep` of Basic.lean: `cF := (nC ^ 2 - 1) / (2 * nC)`, `cA := nC`; `(nC^2-1)/(2nC) = nC \u27fa nC^2 = -1`, unsolvable over \u211d. No other `ColorFactors` literal exists in the repo, and the diff adds no witness.",
