   "fix": "Add the instantiation, e.g. `def susyColorFactors (cA : \u211d) : ColorFactors := \u27e81, cA, cA, cA / 2\u27e9` with `isSupersymmetric_susyColorFactors`, so the three consuming theorems are demonstrably non-vacuous at nonzero colour charge.",
